{"id": "75bed24f-b35d-4c3c-8fc2-406cfae6e24e", "slug": "nova-next-gen-intelligence-1", "title": "Nova - Next Gen Intelligence", "description": "Nova Next Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Nova - Next Gen Intelligence\"\ndescription: \"Nova Next Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#34D399\"\n  secondary: \"#60A5FA\"\n  accent: \"#60A5FA\"\n  background: \"#030303\"\n  surface: \"#18181B\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Geist\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Geist\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Nova - Next Gen Intelligence\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Sourasith Phomhome (@madebysourasith). Views: 333; favorites: 18; remixes: 6.\nTags: feature, section, animated, cta.\n## Overview\nNova Next Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nNova Solutions Company Capabilities Help Get Started Next-gen systems. Engineered for tomorrow Wisdom That Drives Us Onward. We engineer intelligent systems and interactive environments that resolve complex challenges a…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Wisdom That Drives Us Onward..\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #34D399, secondary #60A5FA, accent #60A5FA, background #030303, surface #18181B, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Geist for display moments and Geist for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nAuthentication and CTA controls should preserve the source button hierarchy, input density, and focused conversion path.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\"><head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Nova - Next Gen Intelligence</title>\n\n    <!-- Utilities -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <!-- Animation & WebGL -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <style>\n        .clip-text {\n            background-clip: text;\n            -webkit-background-clip: text;\n            color: transparent;\n        }\n\n        /* Ensure canvas stays in background */\n        #webgl-bg {\n            position: fixed;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            width: 100vw;\n            height: 100vh;\n            z-index: 0;\n            pointer-events: none;\n        }\n\n        /* Selection styling */\n        ::selection {\n            background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);\n            color: white;\n        }\n    </style>\n<link id=\"all-fonts-link-font-geist\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Geist:wght@300;400;500;600;700&amp;display=swap\"><style id=\"all-fonts-style-font-geist\">.font-geist { font-family: 'Geist', sans-serif !important; }</style></head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#030303] text-white font-sans antialiased overflow-x-hidden min-h-screen flex flex-col\">\n\n    <!-- WebGL Canvas Container -->\n    <canvas id=\"webgl-bg\"></canvas>\n\n    <!-- Main Content Wrapper (Above WebGL) -->\n    <div class=\"relative z-10 flex-grow flex flex-col\">\n\n        <!-- Floating Navigation -->\n        <header class=\"fixed top-4 sm:top-6 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[calc(100%-2rem)] max-w-5xl flex items-center justify-between px-4 sm:px-6 py-3 bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-lg border border-white/10 rounded-full z-50\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 cursor-pointer\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:infinity-linear\" class=\"text-3xl text-white\"></iconify-icon>\n                <span class=\"text-xl font-medium tracking-tight text-white font-geist\">Nova</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <nav class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-10\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm font-medium text-gray-300 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200 font-geist\">Solutions</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm font-medium text-gray-300 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200 font-geist\">Company</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm font-medium text-gray-300 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200 font-geist\">Capabilities</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm font-medium text-gray-300 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200 font-geist\">Help</a>\n            </nav>\n\n            <div>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-medium text-white px-5 py-2 rounded-full border border-white/20 hover:bg-white hover:text-black transition-all duration-300 font-geist\">\n                    Get Started\n                </a>\n            </div>\n        </header>\n\n        <!-- Hero Section -->\n        <main class=\"flex-grow flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center px-4 pt-24 pb-32 mt-12 sm:mt-24\">\n\n            <div class=\"gs-fade opacity-0 translate-y-4 mb-6\">\n                <p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium text-gray-400 tracking-wide font-geist\">\n                    Next-gen systems. Engineered for tomorrow\n                </p>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Masked Staggered Text Reveal Structure -->\n            <h1 class=\"text-5xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl lg:text-[5.5rem] font-medium tracking-tighter leading-[1.05] mb-8 max-w-4xl mx-auto flex flex-col items-center gap-1 sm:gap-2\">\n                <div class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-x-3 sm:gap-x-4\">\n                    <span class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden align-top pb-1\">\n                        <span class=\"gs-word inline-block translate-y-[110%] font-geist font-light tracking-tighter\">Wisdom</span>\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden align-top pb-1\">\n                        <span class=\"gs-word inline-block translate-y-[110%] font-geist font-light tracking-tighter\">That</span>\n                    </span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-x-3 sm:gap-x-4\">\n                    <span class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden align-top pb-1\">\n                        <span class=\"gs-word inline-block translate-y-[110%] font-geist font-light tracking-tighter\">Drives</span>\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden align-top pb-1 pr-1\">\n                        <span class=\"gs-word inline-block translate-y-[110%] bg-gradient-to-br from-[#bef264] via-[#34d399] to-[#60a5fa] clip-text font-geist font-light tracking-tighter\">Us Onward.</span>\n                    </span>\n                </div>\n            </h1>\n\n            <div class=\"gs-fade opacity-0 translate-y-4 max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10\">\n                <p class=\"text-base sm:text-lg text-gray-300 font-medium leading-relaxed font-geist\">\n                    We engineer intelligent systems and interactive environments that resolve complex challenges and catalyze meaningful innovation.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"gs-fade opacity-0 translate-y-4 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center gap-5\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-white text-black text-sm font-medium rounded-full hover:bg-gray-100 hover:scale-[1.02] active:scale-[0.98] transition-all duration-300 font-geist\">\n                    View Portfolio\n                </a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"w-full sm:w-auto px-6 py-3.5 text-white text-sm font-medium rounded-full hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors flex items-center justify-center gap-2 group font-geist\">\n                    Discover More\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" class=\"text-lg text-gray-400 group-hover:text-white group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-all duration-300\"></iconify-icon>\n                </a>\n            </div>\n        </main>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Scripts -->\n    <script>\n        // --- WebGL Background Animation ---\n        const initWebGL = () => {\n            const canvas = document.getElementById('webgl-bg');\n            const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ canvas, alpha: true, antialias: true });\n            const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n            const camera = new THREE.OrthographicCamera(-1, 1, 1, -1, 0, 1);\n\n            // Custom fragment shader for diagonal glowing rays\n            const fragmentShader = `\n                uniform float u_time;\n                uniform vec2 u_resolution;\n\n                void main() {\n                    vec2 st = gl_FragCoord.xy / u_resolution.xy;\n\n                    // Maintain aspect ratio for coordinates\n                    float aspect = u_resolution.x / u_resolution.y;\n                    st.x *= aspect;\n\n                    // Rotate coordinates for diagonal effect\n                    float angle = -0.7;\n                    mat2 rot = mat2(cos(angle), -sin(angle), sin(angle), cos(angle));\n                    vec2 pos = rot * st;\n\n                    // Generate thick, rhythmic bands using sine waves\n                    float wave1 = sin(pos.y * 8.0 - u_time * 0.5);\n                    float wave2 = sin(pos.y * 18.0 - u_time * 0.8);\n                    float wave3 = sin(pos.y * 4.0 - u_time * 0.2);\n\n                    // Sharpen the waves into distinct rays\n                    float ray1 = pow(wave1 * 0.5 + 0.5, 6.0);\n                    float ray2 = pow(wave2 * 0.5 + 0.5, 12.0) * 0.5;\n                    float ray3 = pow(wave3 * 0.5 + 0.5, 3.0) * 0.3;\n\n                    float combinedRays = max(max(ray1, ray2), ray3);\n\n                    // Define colors matching the reference (Green to Blue)\n                    vec3 colTopLeft = vec3(0.5, 1.0, 0.3);    // Bright Yellow-Green\n                    vec3 colBottomRight = vec3(0.1, 0.5, 1.0); // Vivid Blue\n\n                    // Mix colors diagonally across the screen\n                    float colorMix = (gl_FragCoord.x / u_resolution.x) * 0.7 + (1.0 - gl_FragCoord.y / u_resolution.y) * 0.3;\n                    vec3 baseColor = mix(colTopLeft, colBottomRight, colorMix);\n\n                    // Apply rays and a subtle ambient glow\n                    vec3 finalColor = baseColor * combinedRays * 1.5;\n                    finalColor += baseColor * 0.05; // Base ambient\n\n                    // Fade out towards edges (Vignette)\n                    float fadeX = smoothstep(0.0, 0.5, st.x / aspect) * smoothstep(1.0, 0.5, st.x / aspect);\n                    float fadeY = smoothstep(0.0, 0.5, st.y) * smoothstep(1.2, 0.3, st.y);\n\n                    // Specific directional fade to match reference (darker top right, brighter bottom left)\n                    float directionalFade = smoothstep(1.5, 0.0, st.x / aspect + st.y * 0.5);\n\n                    gl_FragColor = vec4(finalColor * fadeY * directionalFade, 1.0);\n                }\n            `;\n\n            const geometry = new THREE.PlaneGeometry(2, 2);\n            const material = new THREE.ShaderMaterial({\n                fragmentShader,\n                uniforms: {\n                    u_time: { value: 0 },\n                    u_resolution: { value: new THREE.Vector2() }\n                },\n                transparent: true,\n                depthWrite: false\n            });\n\n            const mesh = new THREE.Mesh(geometry, material);\n            scene.add(mesh);\n\n            const resize = () => {\n                renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n                renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n                material.uniforms.u_resolution.value.set(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n            };\n\n            window.addEventListener('resize', resize);\n            resize();\n\n            const animate = (time) => {\n                requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n                material.uniforms.u_time.value = time * 0.001;\n                renderer.render(scene, camera);\n            };\n            animate(0);\n        };\n\n        // --- GSAP Animations ---\n        const initAnimations = () => {\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n            const tl = gsap.timeline({\n                scrollTrigger: {\n                    trigger: \"main\",\n                    start: \"top 80%\",\n                }\n            });\n\n            // 1. Masked word reveal\n            tl.to(\".gs-word\", {\n                y: \"0%\",\n                duration: 1.2,\n                stagger: 0.12,\n                ease: \"power4.out\",\n            });\n\n            // 2. Fade up subtext and buttons\n            tl.to(\".gs-fade\", {\n                y: 0,\n                opacity: 1,\n                duration: 1,\n                stagger: 0.15,\n                ease: \"power3.out\",\n            }, \"-=0.8\"); // Overlap with headline animation\n        };\n\n        // Initialize on load\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", () => {\n            initWebGL();\n            initAnimations();\n        });\n    </script>\n\n</body></html>", "preview_file_name": "nova-next-gen-intelligence-1.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s-v3/nova-next-gen-intelligence-1.jpg", "source_name": "nova-next-gen-intelligence-1-DESIGN.md", "views": 922, "forks": 43, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "5bd6211c-bd4c-467c-b442-4312cac4712c", "created_at": "2026-04-29T09:15:30.794547+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T20:34:25.993794+00:00"}